      "text": "I make a record of my proceedings, 1 Ne. 1:1. obtain these records, that we may preserve … language of our fathers, 1 Ne. 3:19. record of the Jews from the beginning, 1 Ne. 5:12. he and his fathers had kept the records, 1 Ne. 5:16. words of the Lamb shall be made known in the records, 1 Ne. 13:41. Nephi, had kept the records, 2 Ne. 5:29. after this manner we keep the records, Omni 1:9. they had brought no records with them, Omni 1:17. keep a record of this people, Alma 37:2. have the records of the holy scriptures upon them, Alma 37:3. Jesus commanded that it should be written, 3 Ne. 23:13. hid up in the hill Cumorah all the records, Morm. 6:6. Moroni, do finish the record of my father, Morm. 8:1 (Ether 13:1). brother of Jared … write the things which he had seen, Ether 4:1.",
